{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48301","headline":"戏荅朝士 · 李都","name":"戏荅朝士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华缄千里到荆门，章草纵横任意论。\n应笑锺张虚用力，却教羲献枉劳魂。\n惟堪爱惜爲珍宝，不敢传留误子孙。\n深荷故人相厚处，天行时气许教吞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李都","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}